# onnxruntime-node postinstall fetches ONLY the CUDA EP binaries from GitHub releases
# (upstream v1.21.0 assets currently 404). The CUDA EP is never used — inference runs
# in the browser (WebGPU/wasm); node-side ORT is not loaded in tests. CPU binaries ship
# in the npm package. See script/install.js header in onnxruntime-node.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
